---

---

<section
	id="nosotros"
	class="relative bg-slate-50 py-16 text-slate-900 sm:py-20 lg:py-24 section-animate-init"
	data-animate-section
>
	<div
		class="absolute left-0 bottom-0 hidden w-24 bg-[#080e21] h-[40%] sm:block lg:w-32"
	>
	</div>
	<div
		class="absolute right-0 top-0 hidden w-24 bg-[#00bcff] h-[40%] sm:block lg:w-32"
	>
	</div>

	<div
		class="relative mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-10 px-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:gap-16 lg:px-8"
	>
		<div
			class="relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-white shadow-xl shadow-slate-900/10 lg:w-[46%]"
		>
			<div
				class="absolute -left-24 top-0 h-full w-40 -skew-x-6 bg-sky-500/90 sm:-left-28 lg:-left-32"
			>
			</div>
			<img
				src="/images/section01.webp"
				alt="Equipo legal en reunión"
				class="relative z-10 h-full w-full object-cover"
				loading="lazy"
			/>
		</div>

		<div class="relative z-10 w-full lg:w-[54%]">
			<h2 class="text-2xl tracking-[0.2em] text-sky-500 sm:text-3xl">
				<span class="lang-es">NUESTRA FIRMA</span>
				<span class="lang-en">OUR FIRM</span>
			</h2>
			<div class="mt-3 h-0.5 w-20 bg-sky-500"></div>

			<div
				class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700 sm:text-base"
			>
				<p class="lang-es">
					World Solved Case es una firma de servicios legales y
					consultoría estratégica dedicada a potenciar el valor de los
					negocios y proyectos de nuestros clientes. Con un enfoque
					verdaderamente global, ofrecemos soluciones integrales tanto
					para individuos como para corporaciones.
				</p>
				<p class="lang-es">
					Operamos en mercados clave alrededor del mundo, con
					presencia y actividad en importantes centros financieros y
					empresariales como Nueva York, Miami y Los Ángeles en
					Estados Unidos; Ciudad de México, Bogotá y São Paulo en
					América Latina; Madrid, Londres y París en Europa, entre
					otros.
				</p>

				<p class="lang-en">
					World Solved Case is a legal services and strategic
					consultancy firm dedicated to empowering the value of our
					clients' businesses and projects. With a truly global
					approach, we provide comprehensive solutions for both
					individuals and corporations.
				</p>
				<p class="lang-en">
					World Solved Case operates in key markets around the globe,
					with presence and activities in major financial and business
					centers such as New York, Miami, and Los Angeles in the
					United States; Mexico City, Bogotá, and São Paulo in Latin
					America; Madrid, London, and Paris in Europe, among others.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
